{"id":"2023-new-gaokao-1-20","year":2023,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"新高考I卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江"],"question_no":20,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设等差数列 $ \\{a_n\\} $ 的公差为 $ d $，且 $ d>1 $. 令 $ b_n=\\frac{n^2+n}{a_n} $，记 $ S_n $，$ T_n $ 分别为数列 $ \\{a_n\\} $，$ \\{b_n\\} $ 的前 $ n $ 项和. ； 若 $ 3a_2=3a_1+a_3 $，$ S_3+T_3=21 $，求 $ \\{a_n\\} $ 的通项公式；若 $ \\{b_n\\} $ 为等差数列，且 $ S_{99}-T_{99}=99 $，求 $ d $.","options":null,"answer":"（1）an=3n；（2）d=51/50","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["等差数列"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2023/2023新高考1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江).pdf","sha":"90505e1146e12c0ed0fc296b3568a1ab5e82482c","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设等差数列 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 的公差为 \\(d\\)，且 \\(d>1\\). 令 \\(b_n=\\frac{n^2+n}{a_n}\\)，记 \\(S_n\\)，\\(T_n\\) 分别为数列 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\)，\\(\\{b_n\\}\\) 的前 \\(n\\) 项和.\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(3a_2=3a_1+a_3\\)，\\(S_3+T_3=21\\)，求 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 的通项公式；\n\\item 若 \\(\\{b_n\\}\\) 为等差数列，且 \\(S_{99}-T_{99}=99\\)，求 \\(d\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）an=3n；（2）d=51/50","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2023/new_gaokao_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"1981d12b42676251b42e0fa0f1ecdab198b7621c","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"6416fca0daaae81529486deb8b85348c73a081b41c6b5471a9f18f8cae364fe0","answer_sha256":"9f9f53d646c0250cc429f58cf8d14148ef21fc8bd60da86329ab5c653e826b47"},"verification_status":"verified"}
{"id":"2023-new-gaokao-1-21","year":2023,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"新高考I卷","regions":["山东","广东","湖南","湖北","河北","江苏","福建","浙江"],"question_no":21,"question_type":"solution","stem":"甲乙两人投篮，每次由其中一人投篮，规则如下：若命中则此人继续投篮，若未命中则换为对方投篮. 无论之前投篮情况如何，甲每次投篮的命中率均为 $ 0.6 $，乙每次投篮的命中率均为 $ 0.8 $. 由抽签确定第一次投篮的人选，第一次投篮的人是甲，乙的概率各为 $ 0.5 $. ； 求第二次投篮的人是乙的概率；求第 $ i $ 次投篮的人是甲的概率；已知：若随机变量 $ X_i $ 服从两点分布，且 $ P(X_i=1)=1-P(X_i=0)=q_i $，$ \\ i=1 $，$ 2 $，$ \\dots $，$ n $，则 $ E\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n X_i\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^n q_i $. 记前 $ n $ 次（即从第 $ 1 $ 次到第 $ n $ 次）投篮中甲投篮的次数为 $ Y $，求 $ E(Y) $.","options":null,"answer":"（1）0.6；（2）(1/6)(2/5)^{i-1}+1/3；（3）E(Y)=5/18[1-(2/5)^n]+n/3","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["全概率公式","数学期望"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2023/2023新高考1(山东,广东,湖南,湖北,河北,江苏,福建,浙江).pdf","sha":"90505e1146e12c0ed0fc296b3568a1ab5e82482c","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"甲乙两人投篮，每次由其中一人投篮，规则如下：若命中则此人继续投篮，若未命中则换为对方投篮. 无论之前投篮情况如何，甲每次投篮的命中率均为 \\(0.6\\)，乙每次投篮的命中率均为 \\(0.8\\). 由抽签确定第一次投篮的人选，第一次投篮的人是甲，乙的概率各为 \\(0.5\\).\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求第二次投篮的人是乙的概率；\n\\item 求第 \\(i\\) 次投篮的人是甲的概率；\n\\item 已知：若随机变量 \\(X_i\\) 服从两点分布，且 \\(P(X_i=1)=1-P(X_i=0)=q_i\\)，\\(\\ i=1\\)，\\(2\\)，\\(\\dots\\)，\\(n\\)，则 \\(E\\left(\\sum_{i=1}^n X_i\\right)=\\sum_{i=1}^n q_i\\).\n记前 \\(n\\) 次（即从第 \\(1\\) 次到第 \\(n\\) 次）投篮中甲投篮的次数为 \\(Y\\)，求 \\(E(Y)\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"（1）0.6；（2）(1/6)(2/5)^{i-1}+1/3；（3）E(Y)=5/18[1-(2/5)^n]+n/3","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2023/new_gaokao_paper_1.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"1981d12b42676251b42e0fa0f1ecdab198b7621c","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check